2 Materials and methods
Atomizer design
The main objective of the present work is to investigate the performances related to
the combined use of the air assisted and multiple jet impingement atomization
strategies, in order to evaluate its fitness with the avionic engine. The technique
consists of the introduction of a high speed air stream towards the impingement
point of two or more liquid jets, in order to increase the atomization of the liquid
phase as it approaches the centre and collide.


